{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1206 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "395e69dc35c0a2f623c84d01822289ce0c10e920533de1be156f57240570e266" :edb/db-before-t 1205 :edb/db-after-t 1206 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534518 50 #inst "2026-10-07T19:48:36.684Z" 13194139534518 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292894 13194139534518 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292900 13194139534518 true] [17592186083209 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292905 13194139534518 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292880 13194139534518 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292887 13194139534518 true] [17592186292880 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292881 13194139534518 true] [17592186292880 1089 "q-10418" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292880 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534518 true] [17592186292880 1100 "What is the center of the hyperbola ${x}^{2}-5{y}^{2}+8x+50y=129?$" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292880 1113 #uuid "59d79587-4235-51d5-b256-de9d0719abf9" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292880 1145 "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-5{y}^{2}+8x+50y & =129 \\\\ {x}^{2}+8x-5{y}^{2}+50y & =129 \\\\ {x}^{2}+8x-5[{y}^{2}-10y] & =129 \\\\ (x+4)^{2}-16-5[(y-5)^{2}-25] & =129 \\\\ (x+4)^{2}-16-5(y-5)^{2}+125 & =129 \\\\ (x+4)^{2}-5(y-5)^{2} & =129+16-125 \\\\ (x+4)^{2}-5(y-5)^{2} & =20 \\\\ \\frac{(x+4)^{2}}{20}-\\frac{(y-5)^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center is $(-4,5).$" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292881 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292882 13194139534518 true] [17592186292881 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292883 13194139534518 true] [17592186292881 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292884 13194139534518 true] [17592186292881 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292885 13194139534518 true] [17592186292881 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292886 131941