begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}-3{y}^{2}-40x+6y & =-85 \\\\ 4{x}^{2}-40x-3{y}^{2}+6y & =-85 \\\\ 4[{x}^{2}-10x]-3[{y}^{2}-2y] & =-85 \\\\ 4[(x-5)^{2}-25]-3[(y-1)^{2}-1] & =-85 \\\\ 4(x-5)^{2}-100-3(y-1)^{2}+3 & =-85 \\\\ 4(x-5)^{2}-3(y-1)^{2} & =12 \\\\ \\frac{(x-5)^{2}}{3}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-5)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the center is $(5,1).$" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292889 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292890 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292891 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292892 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292893 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1041 "selection" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292893 13194139534518 true] [17592186292888 1110 #uuid "432ee9b5-9abb-56da-993a-d3c716742f36" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292889 1034 "(4,-3)" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292889 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534518 true] [17592186292889 1111 #uuid "54764fac-8641-5f20-8ebb-b615929b0c5e" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292890 1034 "(-5,-1)" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292890 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534518 true] [17592186292890 1111 #uuid "76f91a20-40ad-5d3b-aa41-cc6a321d6732" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292891 1034 "(1,5)" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292891 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534518 true] [17592186292891 1111 #uuid "6ac86740-16ee-5898-b7ef-01c49df2c681" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292892 1034 "(3,4)" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292892 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534518 true] [17592186292892 1111 #uuid "7ef3f7fc-1289-5033-8aab-675b0e67cc43" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292893 1034 "(5,1)" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292893 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534518 true] [17592186292893 1111 #uuid "7ac61097-76fa-504a-a530-665f32c07d93" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292895 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292898 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1089 "q-274640" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $9{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}-36y+8x=4$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1113 #uuid "9eed80f5-d45f-5a64-bffb-51a629ba4b7f" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292894 1145 "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}-36y+8x & =4 \\\\ 9{y}^{2}-36y-4{x}^{2}+8x & =4 \\\\ 9[{y}^{2}-4y]-4[{x}^{2}-2x] & =4 \\\\ 9[(y-2)^{2}-4]-4[(x-1)^{2}-1] & =4 \\\\ 9(y-2)^{2}-36-4(x-1)^{2}+4 & =4 \\\\ 9(y-2)^{2}-4(x-1)^{2} & =4+36-4 \\\\ 9(y-2)^{2}-4(x-1)^{2} & =36 \\\\ \\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{9} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{2}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{{3}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,1,2\\,).$" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292895 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292896 13194139534518 true] [17592186292895 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292897 13194139534518 true] [17592186292895 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534518 true] [17592186292895 1041 "field-1" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292895 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292896 13194139534518 true] [17592186292895 1110 #uuid "2262b843-6256-5ded-b498-e4c29780e91b" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292896 1034 "1" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292896 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534518 true] [17592186292896 1111 #uuid "ed4fb367-1a3b-53ca-bb96-044ead1ef6cb" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292897 1034 "-1" 13194139534518 true] [17592186292897 1103 #